-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The daemon talks to the GMK87 keyboard through this library (HID image upload,
lighting control, time sync). Only the runtime library is bundled: the src/
modules, package.json, presets.json, the udev rule, and the upstream LICENSE
and README. The upstream Electron app, documentation site, and packet-capture
files are not included because the daemon does not need them.

The bundled code is unmodified from upstream v1.0.4. Its full license text is
kept verbatim at third_party/gmk87-node/LICENSE, as the MIT license requires.
